WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:34.480
The wall of death, Egyptian God Slime.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:40.180
It repels Obelisk's attacks, and it can regenerate to protect Marik.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:45.180
He's defending with Egyptian God Slime until he can get a card to resurrect Ra.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:48.790
But if I attack carelessly, damage will reflect back to me.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:51.290
And the darkness will devour my partner.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.000
But we won't give up!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.870
Trouble can create opportunities!

00:01:56.870 --> 00:02:02.870
Obelisk's Fury
Soul Energy MAX

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:13.720
Look.  Monster Reborn returned to my hand.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:16.580
You know what that means, right?

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:22.190
I will Special Summon Ra again next turn.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:26.720
Hell's darkness has come for you, Yugi.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:32.910
As long as Marik's immortal Egyptian God Slime stands in my way...

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:35.830
...I can't destroy his monsters.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:40.000
Actually, the real thing standing in my way is...

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.170
...Marik's true self that's being sacrificed.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:49.110
If I attack Marik's dark side, that means I'm hurting Marik's true self.

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.240
I'm continuing my turn.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:56.520
I set a card and summon this.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.100
Granadora in defense position.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.190
I end my turn.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:10.570
When it's faceup in defense position, I regain 1000 life points during my Standby Phases.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:16.240
I'll use those points to have God Phoenix incinerate Obelisk next turn.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:22.110
Once Obelisk is gone, there's no way Yugi can win.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.050
My turn.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:30.220
Yugi!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:35.430
If you don't do something this turn, he'll summon Ra next turn!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:40.360
But I sense that Yugi is perplexed in this duel.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.340
Perplexed?

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:45.540
Yeah.  As if he doesn't know whether to attack or not.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:48.540
Oh, right.  You can't see it.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.210
You again, Marik?

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:51.380
Marik!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:56.550
You can't see what Shadow Game they're playing in the Duel Ring.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:04:00.240
Tell us!  What kind of battle is it?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.990
Is it like mine?  Where I was connected to my monsters by an umbilical cord?

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:12.930
In their battle, their other personalities are offered as sacrifices.

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:16.900
What?  The other Yugi is being sacrificed?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:22.360
If a player's life points reach 0, his sacrifice will be buried in eternal darkness.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.040
Including my fragment inside Anzu.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.560
Eternal darkness?

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.520
How many will he bury before he's satisfied?

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:30.760
Yugi!

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.950
Huh?  Did I say something?

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.400
What's wrong?

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:44.570
It's your turn, Yugi.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.580
Yugi hesitates to take my life.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:52.740
Why?

00:04:54.040 --> 00:05:00.480
I've been trying to take your friends' lives.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.020
So why?

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.690
My other self.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.950
Our true enemy is Marik's evil soul.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:16.560
There must be a way to only defeat him!

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.560
Yeah.  But how?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:25.440
Even if I lower his life points to 0, Marik's true self will be the one who's sacrificed.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:28.510
I won't erase his dark side.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.280
Maybe...

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:34.740
Ra's effect may hold the key to his weakness.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:36.180
Ra's effect?

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:40.850
Yeah.  Ra has three battle modes.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:45.280
One is for Ra to fuse with the player.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:50.570
But even if it's a God, it's still a monster.

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:54.970
So fusing means the player turns into a monster.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.030
The player turns into a monster...

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:00.370
I see!  Thank you, partner.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:01.910
I draw!

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:03.880
There's still a way.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:04.910
Yeah.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.080
I set two cards!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:10.590
I summon Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts in defense position!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:12.820
I end my turn!

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:18.160
Whoa!  Before you end your turn, don't forget this attack!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.290
Bowganian, shoot a painful arrow at Yugi!

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:30.350
My other self!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.620
Partner...

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.570
You must defeat Marik's evil soul!

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.780
Partner, I won't let you die!

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:43.210
Keep talking!  No matter what you try, this is your last turn!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:49.590
Due to the regeneration combo, Ra will appear this turn.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.520
Yugi, can you stop it?

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:54.740
Do your best!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.150
Don't lose, Yugi!

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.960
Yugi!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:01.900
I draw!

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.170
Darkness aids me to the end!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:14.240
This card will sacrifice you to the darkness!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.380
Bring it on, Marik!

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:22.320
Due to Granadora's effect, I regain 1000 life points during this Standby Phase!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.910
Here I go.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.930
The flaming wings will kill you!

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.630
I activate my spell card!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:29.760
Monster Reborn!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:42.470
(chanting)

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.640
God Phoenix!

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:53.320
I pay 1000 life points to activate Ra's third effect!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.020
Go!  Incinerate Obelisk!

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:00.620
God Phoenix!

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.490
I flip over my set card!

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.420
Nothing you try will work!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.600
Obelisk is destro-

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:13.770
What?

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:21.610
Slifer the Sky Dragon?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:26.200
Slifer blocked God Phoenix?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:31.820
When you attacked, I also activated a set card.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.260
The spell card...

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.690
...Monster Reborn!

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:40.930
So Obelisk isn't hurt this turn!

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:45.650
I see.  Marik isn't the only one who can use Monster Reborn.

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:48.200
He defended using Slifer!

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:53.650
He's using Obelisk as a sword and Slifer as a shield to fight Ra.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:54.880
Look, brother!

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:07.690
Obelisk is angry.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:14.560
Yugi, do you know Obelisk's true power when it's angry?

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.170
My Phoenix returns to the graveyard.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:29.280
Don't think you've won, Yugi.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.480
I end my Battle Phase.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:32.710
What?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:36.620
He ended his Battle Phase without attacking?

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.650
What's he up to?

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.860
But my turn hasn't ended yet.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:46.600
I told you that this is the last turn.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.930
I activate my spell card!

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.700
Surprise Attack from Beyond!

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.770
Surprise Attack from Beyond?

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.040
I can conduct my Battle Phase again...

00:09:57.260 --> 00:10:01.210
...and resurrect the monster I summoned this turn.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:02.270
What?

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:04.420
Another Battle Phase?

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.420
That card isn't fair!

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:12.590
Marik is going to Special Summon Ra again and finish Yugi.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:28.500
Master Marik...

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.190
Come, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.500
It's coming!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:14.000
Ra isn't in battle mode yet.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.180
Which mode should it attack you with?

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:20.120
This one, of course.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:36.170
(chanting)

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:40.480
That's Ra's second mode.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:44.810
Marik is going to fuse with Ra for a One Turn Kill!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:57.340
Marik will keep 1 life point and transfer the rest to Ra's attack points.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.330
My other self!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.640
Yeah.  I know, partner.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.280
This is the last chance!

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:18.950
Witness how I am one with my God!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:27.820
For this moment only, we can destroy both Marik's dark side and Ra!

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:39.070
Yugi!  By tributing all my monsters, Ra's attack points will rise to 6899!

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:44.050
That's far greater than Obelisk's 4000 attack points.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.510
A single strike will drop your life points to 0!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:49.180
Prepare yourself!

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:51.350
Are you sure?

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:52.280
What?

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:59.890
I was waiting for this moment when your evil soul materializes as a monster!

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.420
I flip over my set card!

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:03.620
Soul Taker!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.930
Brother, what's that card?

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.370
Soul Taker.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:13.570
It's a spell card that tributes your opponent's monster.

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:17.970
And your opponent gains 1000 life points.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.510
Is Yugi going to...?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:23.180
A spell can affect a God for one turn.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.610
You're going to tribute Ra, along with me?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:31.940
Brother!

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:34.090
Like I thought, he's tributing Ra!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:44.360
Since he still has 1 life point, the real Marik won't be killed.

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:52.540
Do you really think you can destroy me by tributing Ra?

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:56.280
I never said I was tributing Ra.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.490
What?

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:00.820
What does he mean?

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.020
What will he tribute?

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.820
I'm tributing... that!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.930
You're tributing my Egyptian God Slime?

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:21.260
Yes.  Egyptian God Slime is the fusion of Metal Reflect Slime and Revival Jam.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:25.490
Therefore, they'll both be tributed!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:31.340
What's the point of tributing my Slime?

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.900
I'll tell you!

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:37.340
To activate Obelisk's mightiest effect!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:40.190
Obelisk's mightiest effect?

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.720
Soul Energy MAX!

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:51.440
Soul Energy MAX...

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:53.570
God's anger creates this miracle.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:56.570
It's Obelisk's mightiest effect.

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:01.440
Will it work against Ra?

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.310
Impossible!  Infinite attack points?

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.750
Here I go, Marik!

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.950
God Hand Impact!

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:23.900
I don't think so!  I tribute Bowganian and Granadora to Ra!

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:30.740
Soul Taker gave Marik 1000 life points, which are transformed into Ra's attack points.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:34.340
So Ra has 1699 attack points.

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:39.980
Ra also absorbs the tributed monsters' attack points.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:47.150
Ra has 4899 attack points!

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:52.330
But since Obelisk has infinite attack points, it can destroy Ra!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:09.680
Did he do it?

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.530
What?

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:17.450
Why isn't it destroyed?

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:22.150
I activated this spell card.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.130
Class System!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:37.070
If your monster's Level isn't greater than mine, your attack and effects are negated.

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:40.750
Ra and Obelisk are both Level 10.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:47.860
So Obelisk's special attack was negated.  Too bad!

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:57.920
After activating its effect, Obelisk's attack points return to 4000.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:00.130
Yugi, you lose.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.560
Yugi's going to lose?

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:05.500
This is my surprise attack from beyond!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.930
It's the final Battle Phase, Yugi!

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.240
Master Marik...

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.380
Don't be rash.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:27.400
Here I go!  Ra attacks!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.990
God Blaze Cannon!

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:33.730
I win!

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:35.240
Are you sure?

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:38.330
I activate my set spell!

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.410
Magical Dimension!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:47.730
This spell activates when your monster attacks when I have a Spellcaster!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:57.410
Due to Magical Dimension, I tribute two monsters on my field!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:00.680
What?

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.650
You're tributing a God?

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:07.280
I tribute Obelisk and Gazelle to avoid Ra's attack!

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:09.410
Sacrifice Escape!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:18.600
I heard your heart's voice, Master Marik.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.110
Rishido...

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:24.110
I'll soon head to the world of darkness.

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:27.720
But I want to tell you something first.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:34.640
I disobeyed my family's laws and committed crimes.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:41.240
Even an eternity of darkness won't make up for what I did to my father.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:53.110
How can you win without your God, Yugi?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.200
I have my friends!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:59.410
And servants in my deck who fought alongside me!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:03.000
Magical Dimension's additional effect!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:09.690
I can Special Summon a Spellcaster-Type monster from my hand!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:11.060
What?

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:12.160
Come out!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.630
Dark Magician!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.670
I see.  He used Obelisk as a decoy.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:29.360
Counterattack Ra this turn!

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:32.460
I flip over my spell card, Ragnarok!

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:37.560
I can activate this card when there are two Magicians on my field!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:45.220
I banish all monsters in my deck, hand and graveyard to destroy all your monsters!

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:48.890
Marik!  Including your fusion with your God!

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:57.900
But Yugi, if you destroy Ra, I'll only have 1 life point left.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:05.780
My other personality doesn't have the strength to survive with only 1 life point.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:12.880
If Ra is destroyed, my other personality will die.

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:20.020
Even if I leave him with 1 life point, I still can't save Marik?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:27.080
Rishido, on the day of the Gravekeepers' ritual, you endured the same pain I did.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:34.200
That's when you decided to share my burden of karma and destiny and live in the darkness.

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:36.380
But it's over.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:41.160
You don't have to suffer anymore.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:49.560
If you're prepared to kill him, then do it!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:55.330
Oh no!  My other self can't attack!

00:20:57.240 --> 00:21:01.100
As long as I have him to sacrifice, I won't lose!

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:11.120
Whether you're alive or dead, head towards the light.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:15.280
You're mistaken, Master Marik.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.780
Thank you, Rishido.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:21.550
Master Marik!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.360
Rishido!

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:37.890
R-Rishido!

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:59.220
That's Rishido?

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:03.760
He's supposed to be asleep in the Battle Ship.  Why is he here?

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:08.090
But when Rishido starts talking, Marik acts differently.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:10.600
Marik's true self is awakening!

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:14.560
Yugi decides to attack, betting on the strength of 1 life point.

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:17.210
It's the climax of Battle City!

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:21.680
Can Yugi defeat Marik's evil side and save everyone?

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:23.980
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Battle City Concludes!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:26.120
Duel, standby!

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:41.150
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:41.650 --> 00:22:49.490
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:51.220 --> 00:23:00.650
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:10.170
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:19.200
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:19.980 --> 00:23:24.710
I'll live feeling them

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:29.890
For me to be me

00:23:29.890 --> 00:23:38.350
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:43.990
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:44.510 --> 00:23:53.650
We'll both understand that someday
